# INVWIN0.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with /NET RISRV
# on the test machine, which has no NetBIOS: the status bar names the
# server, the call fails at once with INV's reason, and ENTER on the
# message box ends the program.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN0.SNP is its
# snapshot.
S NONB
K ENTER
S GONE
